风向变了"},{"english":"she changed the bag from her left hand to her right hand","chinese":"她把袋子从左手换到右手"},{"english":"to change hands","chinese":"转手"}]},{"id":"change:o:44fe22bd7f59","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"换乘","contexts":["train","plane"]},{"id":"change:o:444e6803d7b4","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"转变","contexts":["side"]},{"id":"change:o:bedcbe75430a","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"改变","contexts":["vehicle","wind","river","course"]},{"id":"change:o:01f3e68b73e5","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"另找","glossesEn":["get services of sb different"],"contexts":["lawyer","supplier","agent"],"examples":[{"english":"to change one's doctor","chinese":"另找一位医生看病"},{"english":"he has changed publishers again","chinese":"他又换了出版商"}]},{"id":"change:o:08756c392f7b","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使…转变","glossesEn":["transform"],"contexts":["person","magic spell","process","animal","substance"],"examples":[{"english":"the witch changed him from a prince into a frog","chinese":"巫婆把他从王子变成了青蛙"},{"english":"the sugar is changed into alcohol","chinese":"糖被制成酒精"}]},{"id":"change:o:fa6947ad58cc","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"改变","glossesEn":["become different"],"examples":[{"english":"the price of petrol hasn't changed much","chinese":"汽油价格变化不大"},{"english":"spring changes into summer","chinese":"春去夏来"},{"english":"the colour of the leaves changed from green to brown","chinese":"叶子的颜色由绿转褐"}]},{"id":"change:o:d1aeecfaba0f","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"变换","glossesEn":["to control traffic flow"],"contexts":["traffic lights","signal"],"examples":[{"english":"the traffic lights changed from green to amber","chinese":"交通灯从绿灯变成了黄灯"}]},{"id":"change:o:6845245239b4","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"换衣服","glossesEn":["into different clothes"],"examples":[{"english":"to change for dinner","chinese":"赴宴前更衣"},{"english":"he changed into a clean shirt","chinese":"他换了一件干净的衬衣"},{"english":"you'd better change out of those wet clothes","chinese":"你最好把那些湿衣服都换掉"}]},{"id":"change:o:fb4e1054081d","label":"vi.","def