:"意识到","glossesEn":["be affected emotionally"],"examples":[{"english":"I felt a tremendous sense of loss","chinese":"我感到茫然不知所措"},{"english":"he felt no bitterness towards her","chinese":"他一点儿都不恨她"},{"english":"the loyalty I feel to my former employer","chinese":"我对前一任雇主的耿耿忠心"}]},{"id":"feel:o:22cebcbf6505","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"认为","glossesEn":["think"],"examples":[{"english":"I felt his plan to be impractical","chinese":"我认为他的计划不切实际"},{"english":"she felt she would succeed this time","chinese":"她相信自己这次会成功"},{"english":"she felt that she had seen him before","chinese":"她觉得以前见过他"}]},{"id":"feel:o:90372e11880d","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"摸索","glossesEn":["search with hand etc."],"examples":[{"english":"she felt in her bag for the key","chinese":"她在包里摸索着找钥匙"},{"english":"she felt for the ledge with her foot","chinese":"她用脚探找岩石的突出部"}]},{"id":"feel:o:3bcf59a5c1e2","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"有感觉","glossesEn":["be capable of sensation","physically"],"examples":[{"english":"the dead cannot feel","chinese":"死人没有知觉"}]},{"id":"feel:o:7dbcc0ca571b","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"有感情","glossesEn":["emotionally"]},{"id":"feel:o:3f6c17dd4c72","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"给人…的感觉","glossesEn":["give sensation"],"examples":[{"english":"this bag feels lighter than that one","chinese":"这个袋子给人的感觉比那个轻"},{"english":"how does your leg feel? — a bit better","chinese":"你的腿感觉怎么样？──好点了"},{"english":"it feels cold/warm in here","chinese":"这儿很冷/暖和"}]},{"id":"feel:o:975c5fe1dd05","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"感觉","glossesEn":["experience physically or emotionally"],"examples":[{"english":"how are you feeling? or how do you feel?","chinese":"你感觉怎么样？"},{"english":"I don't feel hungry","chinese":"我不觉得饿"},{"english":"you're (only) as old as you feel","chinese":"心态有多年轻，你就有多年轻"}]},{"id":"feel:o:b93310ecf25c","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"想要某物/做某事；我想喝杯茶/打个盹；你为什么不和他们一起走？──我不愿意；我有时骑车上班，有时走路去：完全取决于我的心情","glossesEn":["be in the mood for"],"examples":[{"english":"I feel like a cup of tea/taking a nap","chinese":"我想喝杯茶/打个盹"},{"english":"why didn't you go with them? — I didn't feel like it","chinese":"你为什么不和他们一起走？──我不愿意"},{"english":"sometimes I cycle to work, sometimes I walk: it all depends on what I feel like or how I feel","chinese":"我有时骑车上班，有时走路去：完全取决于我的心情"}]},{"id":"feel:o:ea0e4e5d0c9b","label":"n.","definitionZh":"触摸","glossesEn":["act of touching"],"examples":[{"english":"he had a feel in his pockets for his key","chinese":"他在口袋里摸钥匙"},{"english":"let me have a feel","chinese":"让我摸一下"}]},{"id":"feel:o:e2778531d28a","label":"n.","definitionZh":"触觉","glossesEn":["sensation to the touch"],"examples":[{"english":"you can tell it's leather by the feel (of it)","chinese":"你一摸就知道它是皮的"},{"english":"the rock was warm to the feel","chinese":"这块岩石摸上去热乎乎的"},{"english":"she likes the feel of the sun on her face","chinese":"她喜欢太阳照在脸上的感觉"}]},{"id":"feel:o:f49a2ebfac67","label":"n.","definitionZh":"气氛","glossesEn":["atmosphere, impression"],"examples":[{"english":"I didn't like the feel of the place","chinese":"我不喜欢这地方的气氛"},{"english":"the cottage had a welcoming feel about it","chinese":"这间村舍令人感到舒适"},{"english":"it has the feel of a French village","chinese":"它给人一种法国村庄的印象"}]},{"id":"feel:o:586bb9567bb1","label":"n.","definitionZh":"天赋","glossesEn":["aptitude"],"examples":[{"english":"to have a feel for language","chinese":"有语言天赋"},{"english":"she has a feel for handling difficult people","chinese":"她天生善于同难缠的人打交道"}]},{"id":"feel:o:cbd9c8e8a5ed","label":"n.","definitionZh":"熟悉","glossesEn":["familiarity, understanding"],"examples":[{"english":"it takes a while to get the feel of operating a different machine","chinese":"想要熟练操作另一台机器是要花时间的"}]}]},"fusion":{"senses":[{"id":"fusion:o:e9650165b730","label":"n.","definitionZh":"熔合","glossesEn":["of metals, cables"]},{"id":"fusion:o:d1e2cdf2f2e1","label":"n.","definitionZh":"合并","glossesEn":["of companies, parties"]},{"id":"fusion:o:546d737d2aca","label":"n.","definitionZh":"混合体","glossesEn":["of flavours"],"examples":[{"english":"a fusion of several styles","chinese":"几种风格的融合"}]},{"id":"fusion:o:cfa489570f26","label":"n.","definitionZh":"核聚变","domains":["Physics"]},{"id":"fusion:o:6cf6e928b907","label":"n.","definitionZh":"融合乐","domains":["Music"]}]},"ham":{"senses":[{"id":"ham:o:4785d968f187","label":"n.","definitionZh":"火腿肉","glossesEn":["meat"]},{"id":"ham:o:32fbf98f06ac","label":"n.","definitionZh":"火腿","glossesEn":["pig leg"]},{"id":"ham:o:73466fa1037a","label":"n.","definitionZh":"大腿根部","glossesEn":["back of thigh"]},{"id":"ham:o:81fccfc6f00d","label":"n.","definitionZh":"股臀部","glossesEn":["buttocks"]},{"id":"ham:o:6491cb6681d6","label":"n.","definitionZh":"表演过火的演员","glossesEn":["actor"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"a ham actor","chinese":"一个表演过火的演员"}]},{"id":"ham:o:45a7cd59369c","label":"n.","definitionZh":"业余无线电爱好者","registers":["informal"]},{"id":"ham:o:c9105d7457c9","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"过火地表演","contexts":["actor","part","role"]},{"id":"ham:o:ffde68e1c089","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"装腔作势"}]},"healing":{"senses":[{"id":"healing:o:77f29f533346","label":"n.","definitionZh":"康复","glossesEn":["of person"]},{"id":"healing:o:b21c9bd7f418","label":"n.","definitionZh":"愈合","glossesEn":["of wound, cut"]},{"id":"healing:o:9fab00ff1973","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"有疗效的","examples":[{"english":"to have a healing effect","chinese":"有疗效"},{"english":"the healing process","chinese":"康复过程"},{"english":"the gift of healing hands","chinese":"手到病除的本领"}]}]},"immobile":{"senses":[{"id":"immobile:o:b10618ed390a","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"静止的","glossesEn":["motionless"]},{"id":"immobile:o:ee7d1d0578e3","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"无法移动的","glossesEn":["unable to move"]}]},"lest":{"senses":[{"id":"lest:o:d4c06f2e0427","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"以免","glossesEn":["for fear that"],"examples":[{"english":"he wrote down the address lest he forget it","chinese":"他把地址写下来以免忘记"},{"english":"he took his umbrella lest it (should or might) rain","chinese":"他怕下雨，就带了伞"